#. Tag: title
#: expressions.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Expressions"
msgstr "Expressions"

#. Tag: primary
#: expressions.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "expressions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Expressions are a way to quickly insert common phrases into a document. Once "
"an expression has been selected, the text is inserted into &kword;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Expressions are different from variables. Expressions are inserted as "
"regular text, can only be changed later by manually editing the text. "
"Variables, insert a placeholder in the document which can be automatically "
"updated at a later date."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: expressions.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using expressions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "To use an expression could not be easier."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Simply place the cursor at the location you want the expression inserted and "
"select <menuchoice> <guimenu>Insert</guimenu><guisubmenu>Expression</"
"guisubmenu> </menuchoice> from the menubar. This will give you a submenu "
"with groups of expressions. Select the group that is appropriate for your "
"expression. This will bring up a list of expressions available to you. "
"Select the appropriate expression."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "Once selected, that expression will be inserted at the cursor position."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: expressions.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "Add, change and delete expression groups and expressions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adding an expression is accomplished by selecting <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Edit Personal Expressions...</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice> from the menubar. This will bring up a dialog box."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The list at the left shows you all available groups (<emphasis>Employees</"
"emphasis> and <emphasis>Notices</emphasis> in the example above). "
"<emphasis>Notices</emphasis> is the currently selected group."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: expressions.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "Add a new group"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will need to create a new group the first time you want to add a new "
"expression. &kword; will not allow the user to edit or remove any predefined "
"expressions. You create a new group by clicking on the <guibutton>New</"
"guibutton> located <emphasis>below the group list</emphasis>. A new group "
"will be created with the name <emphasis>new group</emphasis>. You can change "
"the name of the new group by clicking on the newly created group in the "
"group list on the left, then editing the text box on the right labeled "
"<guilabel>Group name:</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: expressions.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change the name of a group"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To change the name of a group, simply click on the group in the list on the "
"left side of the dialog. Type the new name in the text box labeled "
"<guilabel>Group name:</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: expressions.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete a group"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To delete a group, click on the group in the list on the left side of the "
"dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Be sure you have selected the correct group prior to clicking on the "
"<guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button. &kword; will not give you the "
"opportunity to restore the group if it is accidentally deleted."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button <emphasis>below the group "
"list</emphasis>. The group and all of the expressions it contained are "
"immediately deleted."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:59 expressions.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Deleting an expression with this dialog does not delete the expression from "
"any document. It only removes the expression from the menus."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: expressions.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "Add a new expression to a group"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left side of the dialog box lists all the available groups. Select the "
"group you want to add your expression to by clicking with the &LMB; on the "
"name of the group. The list on the right of the dialog labeled "
"<guilabel>Expressions</guilabel> lists all the current expressions in the "
"current group."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add an expression, click on the <guibutton>New</guibutton> located "
"<emphasis>below the expression list</emphasis>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A new expression is created called <emphasis>empty</emphasis>. Type your new "
"expression in the textbox below the list of expressions."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: expressions.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Edit an expression in a group"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left side of the dialog box lists all the available groups. Select the "
"group that contains your expression to by clicking with the &LMB; on the "
"name of the group. The list on the right of the dialog labeled "
"<guilabel>Expressions</guilabel> lists all the current expressions in the "
"current group."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click on the expression you want to edit in the expression list on the right."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click in the text box below the expression list. You can now edit your "
"expression in the textbox below the list of expressions."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you are finished adding new expressions, simply click <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: expressions.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "Delete an expression"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To delete an expression, click on the group in the list on the left side of "
"the dialog. This will show a list of the expressions belonging to that group "
"in the listbox on the right labeled <guilabel>Expressions</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the expression you want to delete by clicking once with the &LMB;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Be sure you have selected the correct expression prior to clicking on the "
"<guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button. &kword; will not give you the "
"opportunity to restore the expression if it is accidentally deleted."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button <emphasis>below the "
"expression list</emphasis>. The expression is immediately deleted."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: expressions.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "When you are finished making changes, simply click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>."
msgstr ""

